Title: Presentation of the 25th, 26th, 32nd, 37th and 39th Reports of the Public Accounts Committee. 

PROF. VIJAY KUMAR MALHOTRA (SOUTH DELHI): Sir, I beg to lay on the Table the Statements (Hindi and English versions) showing action taken by Government on the recommendations contained in the following Action Taken Reports of the Pubic Accounts Committee:

(1) 25th Report (14th Lok Sabha) on “Non-realisation of Foreign exchange”;

(2) 26th Report (14th Lok Sabha) on “Ganga Action Plan”;

(3) 32nd Report (14th Lok Sabha) on “Excesses over Voted Grants and Charged Appropriations (2002-2003)”;

(4) 37th Report (14th Lok Sabha ) on “Review of Norms for re-appropriation of funds”; and

(5) 39th Report (14th Lok Sabha) on “Procurement and Utilization of Plant and Equipment in DRDO”.

